      "vector_id": "vault-head-state/v0.1/mac-fail-tampered-head-mac",
      "description": "Final byte of the trailing head_mac flipped. The baseline is NOT AEAD-encrypted, so the reject comes from the head's own HMAC-SHA-256 verification under DeriveSubkey(root_key, 'vault-head-mac') — a distinguishable MacMismatch, not a non-distinguishing AEAD failure. This is the load-bearing property of the MYH1 family: integrity without confidentiality, because the record is bytes the server already relays.",
